      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَتَالَتِ الأُمُورُ</span></b>  <i>The things,</i> or <i>events, were
consecutive; they followed one another.</i> (M, K.)
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَتِ الخَيْلُ تَتَالِيًا</span> <i>The horses,</i> or <i>horsemen,
came consecutively.</i> (S.)

